# OpenCode iOS: fail gracefully before entering OpenTUI on TERM=dumb.
# Applies after 0018 to pinned upstream e8238bae9b807b72ecfc75afd3a9fe2e6b07b944.
# Both interactive frontends print headless commands and rc=1 without opening
# the renderer or starting a server. Normal NewTerm/xterm TTY paths are unchanged.
# Device acceptance includes a real TERM=dumb PTY and terminal restoration.

